"author":{"date":"2025-07-02T10:31:18Z","email":"moldovan0991@gmail.com","name":"Marian C Moldovan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-02T10:31:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: when opening a reference dialog, the DataSourceTableController was using the url parameters to apply sort values. So when having a filter in a main collection, the sorting was applied also to the dialog one, also on fields the referenced collection may not have. Implemented a small fix, similar to what is being applied to the filter feature when used in a dialog, using the updateUrl prop. This is a fix for https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/issues/702. (#704)","tree":{"sha":"6c05639a2e2caef96558c7fba18d165567800e1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codessentia/gitbooklike/git/trees/6c05639a2e2caef96558c7fba18d165567800e1b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/codessentia/gitbooklike/git/commits/a627f1d1e419fc4785bc537f19dc1506d3f3596f","verification":{"payload":"tree 6c05639a2e2caef96558c7fba18d165567800e1b\nparent a05357be19923c876c5a4dcb1fe1da37e2efc232\nauthor Marian C Moldovan <moldovan0991@gmail.com> 1751452278 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1751452278 +0200\n\nfix: when opening a reference dialog, the DataSourceTableController was using the url parameters to apply sort values. So when having a filter in a main collection, the sorting was applied also to the dialog one, also on fields the referenced collection may not have. Implemented a small fix, similar to what is being applied to the filter feature when used in a dialog, using the updateUrl prop. This is a fix for https://github.com/firecmsco/firecms/issues/702. (#704)\n\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJoZQp2CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAIYIQAGDTXK8b2/XVzDwqqsHDeqAj\nfogLJl/NO6uQT0twAhwPomuBsjtldzcq2QfOGTLLbO2AVJlxfSojZwPs/m0FgcS4\nYEzynOxlU6WsicDYb+iyhQ2XxLoVHgg2D+FirVLzucmkSYxTKsy07G9mWRspEKYD\njvbAauH2MiYS7assqu7DQ9v0A+IdOeHWjwOKYSd