16846,"login":"actions-user","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1OTE2ODQ2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/actions-user/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/actions-user/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/actions-user/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/actions-user/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/actions-user/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/actions-user","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AustinMander/smoke-runner/commits/eeb2fbc2b6221b48e8957aa9040e404eaff0bbf2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-08T14:02:05Z","email":"action@github.com","name":"Smoke Runner Bot"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-08T14:02:05Z","email":"action@github.com","name":"Smoke Runner Bot"},"message":"🔥 Initial release: Smoke Runner v1.0.0\n\n✨ Features:\n- 🗺️ Smart route discovery for Next.js apps\n- 🤖 AI-powered test suggestions with dummy proposer\n- ♿ Accessibility testing with Axe integration\n- ⚡ Performance audits with Lighthouse\n- 🖼️ Visual regression testing with baseline management\n- 🔐 Multi-auth support (cookie, magic link, basic, OAuth)\n- 🌱 Test data seeding with multi-database support\n- 📊 Rich reporting with Slack integration\n- ⚙️ CI/CD ready with GitHub Actions workflows\n\n🏗️ Architecture:\n- Monorepo structure with auto-smoke and ai-sidecar packages\n- TypeScript throughout with comprehensive type definitions\n- Playwright for cross-browser testing\n- Extensible plugin architecture\n\n🎯 Production Ready:\n- Error resilience with retries and timeouts\n- Concurrent testing with configurable limits\n- Memory optimization with evidence caching\n- Security-first auth handling\n- Developer experience with file watching and detailed logging\n\n🚀 Generated with Claude Code\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"36615af1d8127808c24fc2388f062b74a8caca22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AustinMander/smoke-runner/git/trees/36615af1d8127808c24fc2388f062b74a8caca22"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AustinMander/smoke-runner/git/commits/eeb2fbc2b6221b48e8957aa9040e404eaff0bbf2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/65916846?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/actions-user/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/actions-user/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/actions-user/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/actions-user/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/actions-user","id":65916846,"login":"actions-user","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1OTE2ODQ2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/actions-user/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/actions-user/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/actions-user/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/actions-user/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/actions-user/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/actions-user","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AustinMander/smoke-runner/commit/eeb2fbc2b6221b48e8957aa9040e404eaff0bbf2","node_id":"C_kwDOPaiKA9oAKGVlYjJmYmMyYjYyMjFiNDhlODk1N2FhOTA0MGU0MDRlYWZmMGJiZjI","parents":[],"sha":"eeb2fbc2b6221b48e8957aa9040e404eaff0bbf2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AustinMander/smoke-runner/commits/eeb2fbc2b6221b48e8957aa9040e404eaff0bbf2"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/AustinMander/smoke-runner/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=56e6659dda43ad3424809f7d629979cf573c01e3&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T15%3A39%3A28.238Z"}');
