om/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nkpng2k/ocp-secrets-management/commit/ce4c7da06ddbee8d773c682d61f7cf9b711519ef","node_id":"C_kwDOPapjldoAKGNlNGM3ZGEwNmRkYmVlOGQ3NzNjNjgyZDYxZjdjZjliNzExNTE5ZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nkpng2k/ocp-secrets-management/commit/2f84613bcb114341c44eba8318f94c4624edb13d","sha":"2f84613bcb114341c44eba8318f94c4624edb13d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkpng2k/ocp-secrets-management/commits/2f84613bcb114341c44eba8318f94c4624edb13d"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/nkpng2k/ocp-secrets-management/commit/c7f6b03eac533862218a23393f20fdd09b44519f","sha":"c7f6b03eac533862218a23393f20fdd09b44519f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkpng2k/ocp-secrets-management/commits/c7f6b03eac533862218a23393f20fdd09b44519f"}],"sha":"ce4c7da06ddbee8d773c682d61f7cf9b711519ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkpng2k/ocp-secrets-management/commits/ce4c7da06ddbee8d773c682d61f7cf9b711519ef"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkpng2k/ocp-secrets-management/commits/c7f6b03eac533862218a23393f20fdd09b44519f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T17:58:36Z","email":"anankuma@anankuma-thinkpadp1gen7.bengluru.csb","name":"Anand Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-19T08:59:16Z","email":"anankuma@anankuma-thinkpadp1gen7.bengluru.csb","name":"Anand Kumar"},"message":"feat(ci): Add operator CI Dockerfile for OpenShift CI builds\n\nAdd Dockerfile for building operator image in OpenShift CI environment.\n\nThis Dockerfile is used by OpenShift CI (not local development) to build\nthe operator image during PR checks and post-merge builds.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Created operator/images/ci/Dockerfile\n  - Multi-stage build using OpenShift CI builder image\n  - Stage 1: Build operator binary with Go 1.23\n  - Stage 2: Runtime image using UBI9-minimal\n  - Runs as non-root user (65532:65532)\n\n## Build Process\n\nStage 1 (Builder):\n- Base: registry.ci.openshift.org/ocp/builder:rhel-9-golang-1.23-openshift-4.21\n- Copies operator source code\n- Runs: make build\n- Produces: bin/manager binary\n\nStage 2 (Runtime):\n- Base: registry.access.redhat.com/ubi9-minimal:latest\n- Copies manager binary from builder stage\n- Sets non-root user for security\n- Entrypoint: /usr/bin/manager\n\n## Usage\n\nThis Dockerfile is referenced in the OpenShift CI configuration:\n- File: release/ci-operator/config/openshift/ocp-secrets-management-console/\n        openshift-ocp-secrets-management-console-main.yaml\n- Section: images.items[]\n- Used for: PR checks, post-merge builds, FIPS scans, E2E tests\n\n## Differences from Development Dockerfile\n\nDevelopment (operator/Dockerfile):\n- Used for: local builds, quay.io pushes\n- Base images: May differ from CI\n\nCI (operator/images/ci/Dockerfile):\n- Used for: OpenShift CI only\n- Base images: Official OpenShift CI images\n- Consistent with other OpenShift operators (cert-manager, external-secrets)\n\n## Related\n\nThis change is part of implementing production CI/CD for the console plugin:\n- Enables automatic operator image builds in CI\n- Required for bundle image substitution\n- Required for E2E testing via OLM\n- Required for FIPS compliance scanning\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1d1e9a39065dc7cba22cc3cc14dba423a9fe7a3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkpng2k/ocp-secrets-management/git/trees/1d1e9a39065dc7cba22cc3cc14dba423a9fe7a3e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkpng2k/ocp-secrets-management/git/commits/c7f6b03eac533862218a23393f20fdd09b44519f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/nkpng2k/ocp-secrets-management/commit/c7f6b03eac533862218a23393f20fdd09b44519f","node_id":"C_kwDOPapjldoAKGM3ZjZiMDNlYWM1MzM4NjIyMThhMjMzOTNmMjBmZGQwOWI0NDUxOWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nkpng2k/ocp-secrets-management/commit/2f84613bcb114341c44eba8318f94c4624edb13d","sha":"2f84613bcb114341c44eba8318f94c4624edb13d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkpng2k/ocp-secrets-management/commits/2f84613bcb114341c44eba8318f94c4624edb13d"}],"sha":"c7f6b03eac533862218a23393f20fdd09b44519f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkpng2k/ocp-secrets-management/commits/c7f6b03eac533862218a23393f20fdd09b44519f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45570819?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakpurohit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakpurohit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakpurohit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakpurohit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sarthakpurohit","id":45570819,"login":"sarthakpurohit","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NTcwODE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakpurohit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakpurohit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakpurohit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakpurohit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakpurohit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakpurohit","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkpng2k/ocp-secrets-management/commits/2f84613bcb114341c44eba8318f9