-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-19T04:50:29Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nkpng2k/ocp-secrets-management/commit/2f84613bcb114341c44eba8318f94c4624edb13d","node_id":"C_kwDOPapjldoAKDJmODQ2MTNiY2IxMTQzNDFjNDRlYmE4MzE4Zjk0YzQ2MjRlZGIxM2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nkpng2k/ocp-secrets-management/commit/d10085fa587fdb1ceeb110811f796907314a9eda","sha":"d10085fa587fdb1ceeb110811f796907314a9eda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkpng2k/ocp-secrets-management/commits/d10085fa587fdb1ceeb110811f796907314a9eda"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/nkpng2k/ocp-secrets-management/commit/72d6c4fb4847f3462833041e87c5f735cee7ddee","sha":"72d6c4fb4847f3462833041e87c5f735cee7ddee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkpng2k/ocp-secrets-management/commits/72d6c4fb4847f3462833041e87c5f735cee7ddee"}],"sha":"2f84613bcb114341c44eba8318f94c4624edb13d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkpng2k/ocp-secrets-management/commits/2f84613bcb114341c44eba8318f94c4624edb13d"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkpng2k/ocp-secrets-management/commits/72d6c4fb4847f3462833041e87c5f735cee7ddee/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T10:37:59Z","email":"anankuma@anankuma-thinkpadp1gen7.bengluru.csb","name":"Anand Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T10:37:59Z","email":"anankuma@anankuma-thinkpadp1gen7.bengluru.csb","name":"Anand Kumar"},"message":"feat: Add production-ready OLM bundle deployment support\n\nThis commit implements complete OLM bundle support for production\ndeployment via OperatorHub, enabling the operator to use plugin\nimages from the bundle instead of hardcoded defaults.\n\n## Changes\n\n### Operator Code Changes\n\n**operator/pkg/controller/secretsmanagementconfig_controller.go**\n- Modified to read plugin image from RELATED_IMAGE_PLUGIN env var\n- Added fallback to default image if env var not set\n- Maintains backward compatibility with direct deployment\n\n**operator/scripts/patch-bundle-csv.go**\n- Enhanced to automatically inject RELATED_IMAGE_PLUGIN env var into CSV\n- Adds relatedImages section for air-gapped deployment support\n- Validates bundle completeness during generation\n- Provides detailed logging and feedback\n\n**operator/Makefile**\n- Added PLUGIN_IMG parameter passing to bundle generation\n- Added logging to show operator and plugin images being used\n- Enables automated bundle enhancement workflow\n\n### Bundle Manifest Changes\n\n**operator/bundle/manifests/*.clusterserviceversion.yaml**\n- Added RELATED_IMAGE_PLUGIN environment variable to operator deployment\n- Added relatedImages section with plugin image reference\n- Enables OLM to inject correct plugin image at deployment time\n\n### Deployment Scripts\n\n**scripts/deploy-to-cluster.sh**\n- Added --bundle option to build bundle images\n- Added build_bundle() function with validation\n- Maintains backward compatibility (existing options unchanged)\n- Gracefully handles missing tools (kustomize, operator-sdk)\n\n**scripts/deploy-via-bundle.sh** (NEW)\n- Complete OLM bundle deployment script (~380 lines)\n- Deploys via operator-sdk run bundle (production method)\n- Builds all 3 images (plugin, operator, bundle)\n- Verifies RELATED_IMAGE_PLUGIN env var in operator\n- Verifies plugin uses correct image from bundle\n- Creates SecretsManagementConfig CR\n- Includes --deploy and --undeploy options\n- Comprehensive verification and status output\n\n### Documentation\n\n**README.md**\n- Updated deployment methods section\n- Added references to both deployment scripts\n- Documented direct vs bundle deployment methods\n\n## Features Implemented\n\n✅ Production-Ready Bundle Support:\n   - Operator reads plugin image from bundle (not hardcoded)\n   - Bundle contains all image references (air-gap ready)\n   - Automated bundle generation with image injection\n\n✅ Two Deployment Methods:\n   - Direct deployment (fast, for development)\n   - Bundle deployment (production-ready, via OLM)\n\n✅ Backward Compatibility:\n   - Existing workflows still work\n   - Fallback to defaults if bundle not used\n   - No breaking changes\n\n✅ Verification & Testing:\n   - Automated verification of bundle contents\n   - Checks operator receives correct env vars\n   - Validates plugin uses image from bundle\n\n## How It Works\n\n### Bundle Deployment Flow:\n1. Build plugin image → quay.io/user/ocp-secrets-management:tag\n2. Build operator image → quay.io/user/...-operator:tag\n3. Generate bundle with PLUGIN_IMG → CSV gets RELATED_IMAGE_PLUGIN\n4. Build bundle image → quay.io/user/...-bundle:tag\n5. Deploy via OLM → operator-sdk run bundle\n6. OLM reads CSV → creates operator with RELATED_IMAGE_PLUGIN env var\n7. Operator deploys plugin → reads image from env var ✓\n\n### Key Environment Variable Flow:\n```\nScript (PLUGIN_IMG)\n  → Makefile (PLUGIN_IMG)\n    → patch-bundle-csv.go (injects into CSV)\n      → Bundle CSV (RELATED_IMAGE_PLUGIN)\n        → OLM (sets env var on operator)\n          → Operator (reads from env)\n            → Plugin Deployment (correct image!) ✓\n```\n\n## Testing\n\nTested on OpenShift cluster:\n- ✅ Direct deployment works (existing method)\n- ✅ Bundle build works (--bundle option)\n- ✅ Bundle deployment works (deploy-via-bundle.sh)\n- ✅ Operator receives RELATED_IMAGE_PLUGIN from bundle\n- ✅ Plugin uses correct image from bundle (not default)\n- ✅ Backward compatibility maintained\n\n## Related Files\n\nDocumentation files created (moved to /flowchart/seceret-management/):\n- BUNDLE_DEPLOYMENT_FLOWCHART.md - Visual flowchart of deployment\n- BUNDLE_DEPLOYMENT_TEST_GUIDE.md - Step-by-step testing guide\n- DEPLOYMENT_METHODS.md - Comparison of deployment methods\n- PRODUCTION_BUNDLE_GUIDE.md - Production deployment guide\n- BUNDLE_QUICK_START.md - Quick reference\n- CHANGES_SUMMARY.md - Detailed changelog\n\n## Impact\n\nThis change enables production deployment via OperatorHub by ensuring\nthe plugin image reference flows from the bundle to the running plugin,\nmaking the deployment air-gap ready and production-ready.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e619c7754687f4194b1cf2040f032f00ed7e4e44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkpng2k/ocp-secrets-management/git/trees/e619c7754687f4194b1cf2040f032f00ed7e4e44"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkpng2k/ocp-secrets-management/git/commits/72d6c4fb4847f3462833041e87c5f735cee7ddee","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/nkpng2k/ocp-secrets-management/commit/72d6c4fb4847f3462833041e87c5f735cee7ddee","node_id":"C_kwDOPapjldoAKDcyZDZjNGZiNDg0N2YzNDYyODMzMDQxZTg3YzVmNzM1Y2VlN2RkZWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nkpng2k/ocp-secrets-management/commit/f03c1018f90072216898b31ba44143857e0b9cba","sha":"f03c1018f90072216898b31ba44143857e0b9cba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkpng2k/ocp-secrets-management/commits/f03c1018f90072216898b31ba44143857e0b9cba"}],"sha":"72d6c4fb484