/sarthakpurohit/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakpurohit/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakpurohit","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkpng2k/ocp-secrets-management/commits/33cd15d83ecefccbe22bb59ce0df51ca4ef60657/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-10T01:45:23Z","email":"sarthakpurohit@gmail.com","name":"Sarthak Purohit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-17T08:52:07Z","email":"sarthakpurohit@gmail.com","name":"Sarthak Purohit"},"message":"feat: Add comprehensive E2E test suite with Playwright\n\nImplement 36 end-to-end tests (19 pre-merge + 17 post-merge) covering\nall three supported operators: cert-manager, External Secrets Operator,\nand Secrets Store CSI Driver.\n\nPre-merge tests use mocked API responses and require no live cluster.\nPost-merge tests run against a real OpenShift cluster validating\nresource listing, deletion, inspection, expiry warnings, and CSI\nSecretProviderClass integration.\n\nAlso adds Makefile targets (test-e2e-*), updates README with E2E\ndocumentation, and fixes the help target regex to support numeric\ntarget names.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"7fcd947903fb6c80ea06d229f1edf703a9761ec5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkpng2k/ocp-secrets-management/git/trees/7fcd947903fb6c80ea06d229f1edf703a9761ec5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkpng2k/ocp-secrets-management/git/commits/33cd15d83ecefccbe22bb59ce0df51ca4ef60657","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45570819?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakpurohit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakpurohit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakpurohit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"http