github.com/repos/nkpng2k/ocp-secrets-management/commits/46ccc47d6848d66346010a9e8635ce45ebaa0cb1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-12T07:22:32Z","email":"anankuma@anankuma-thinkpadp1gen7.bengluru.csb","name":"Anand Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-12T07:22:32Z","email":"anankuma@anankuma-thinkpadp1gen7.bengluru.csb","name":"Anand Kumar"},"message":"Add Codecov integration for code coverage reporting\n\nThis commit adds comprehensive Codecov integration to enable code\ncoverage tracking and reporting for the ocp-secrets-management-console\nplugin.\n\nChanges:\n- Configure Jest for coverage collection with lcov and json reporters\n- Add .codecov.yml with coverage thresholds and ignore patterns\n- Create images/ci/Dockerfile.coverage for CI coverage builds\n- Update test-prow-e2e.sh to support coverage collection mode\n- Add Codecov badge to README\n- Document coverage setup and workflow in README\n\nCoverage settings:\n- Minimum threshold: 50% for all metrics\n- Coverage formats: lcov, json, text, html\n- Ignores test files, mocks, and build artifacts\n- Separate flags for unit and e2e coverage\n\nRelated to external-secrets-operator codecov integration pattern.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8a46840589b2fd8b5cf1136be9b81ded9911a501","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkpng2k/ocp-secrets-management/git/trees/8a46840589b2fd8b5cf1136be9b81ded9911a501"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkpng2k/ocp-secrets-management/git/commits/46ccc47d6848d66346010a9e8635ce45ebaa0cb1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/nkpng2k/ocp-secrets-management/commit/46ccc47d6848d66346010a9e8635ce45ebaa0cb1","node_id":"C_kwDOPapjldoAKDQ2Y2NjNDdkNjg0OGQ2NjM0NjAxMGE5ZTg2MzVjZTQ1ZWJhYTBjYjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nkpng2k/ocp-secrets-management/commit/dbc3d4352deeb4c2cabd25efd08117