pport workspace\n  paths containing spaces\n- Add scripts/tsconfig.json for containerized CRD scripts (fixes TS 7.x\n  deprecation errors inside the scripts container)\n- Make chown non-fatal in containerized targets (large UIDs unsupported\n  by Alpine''s busybox chown)\n- Add missing \"typecheck\" script to package.json\n- Upgrade Dockerfile build stage from nodejs-18 to nodejs-20 (required\n  by copy-webpack-plugin v14 which uses Array.toSorted)\n- Replace react-helmet with SDK DocumentTitle (fixes TS2786 with\n  React 18 types)\n- Widen TFunction parameter type in helper functions (fixes TS2345)\n- Switch tsconfig jsx to react-jsx and include setup-tests.ts (fixes\n  TS2686 UMD global and TS2339 jest-dom matcher errors)\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"9002c6107d5c3ef776f3ca84b5cd626327c97f2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkpng2k/ocp-secrets-management/git/trees/9002c6107d5c3ef776f3ca84b5cd626327c97f2c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkpng2k/ocp-secrets-management/git/commits/bbc48e6f3fca07fc01c4e6554713562cf1b16e85","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45570819?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakpurohit/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakpurohit/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakpurohit/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakpurohit/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sarthakpurohit","id":45570819,"login":"sarthakpurohit","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NTcwODE5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakpurohit/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakpurohit/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sarthakpurohit/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sart