.github.com/repos/nkpng2k/ocp-secrets-management/commits/258b32309672dc2bc862b55fded52a085a4e57ed"}],"sha":"9a4a9ced91b8395f358edec00097f50e74769574","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkpng2k/ocp-secrets-management/commits/9a4a9ced91b8395f358edec00097f50e74769574"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkpng2k/ocp-secrets-management/commits/258b32309672dc2bc862b55fded52a085a4e57ed/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-28T10:15:29Z","email":"anankuma@anankuma-thinkpadp1gen7.bengluru.csb","name":"Anand Kumar"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-28T10:15:29Z","email":"anankuma@anankuma-thinkpadp1gen7.bengluru.csb","name":"Anand Kumar"},"message":"Merge upstream console-plugin-template changes\n\nIncorporates latest upstream improvements from openshift/console-plugin-template:\n- Upgraded to React 18 and PatternFly 6.4.3\n- Migrated from Cypress to Playwright for e2e testing\n- Added Jest unit testing infrastructure with SWC\n- Updated to Yarn 4.14.1 (Berry)\n- Modernized ESLint configuration (flat config)\n- Updated TypeScript to 5.9.3\n- Updated all dependencies to latest versions\n- Added new test infrastructure (jest.config.ts, playwright.config.ts)\n- Improved development tooling and build configuration\n\nPreserved all ocp-secrets-management-console specific features:\n- CRD type generation scripts (fetch-crds, generate-types)\n- SecretsManagement and ResourceInspect routes\n- Custom navigation section for plugins\n- Project-specific CLAUDE.md instructions\n- js-yaml dependency for CRD handling\n\nNext step: yarn install to regenerate yarn.lock\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c8a7f24ad06893a607adfbc146b46ed9a1ea1ed0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkpng2k/ocp-secrets-management/git/trees/c8a7f24ad06893a607adfbc146b46ed9a1ea1ed0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkpng2k/ocp-secrets-management/git/commits/258b32309672dc2bc862b55fded52a085a4e57ed","verification":{"payloa