robot-cli/commits/94e395520fe714fdfe595a754e0966a2e133238c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-28T16:51:01Z","email":"ycyplus@gmail.com","name":"ChenYu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-28T16:51:01Z","email":"ycyplus@gmail.com","name":"ChenYu"},"message":"fix: mark 9 non-existent repos as coming-soon, filter from UI\n\nRoot cause: configs had repos that never existed on GitHub (404):\nrobot-admin-base, robot-react, robot-react-base, robot-uniapp-base,\nrobot-nest, robot-nest-base, robot-nest-micro, robot-electron, robot-electron-base\n\nChanges:\n- Add status:''coming-soon'' to all 9 templates\n- Filter coming-soon from all 4 selection flows (recommended/category/search/all)\n- Show ''+ N 个模板开发中'' hint instead of allowing selection of broken templates\n- Category with 0 available templates shows friendly message and goes back","tree":{"sha":"fd0ce3edfe522ccd735aef7935ae43905427837b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChenyCHENYU/robot-cli/git/trees/fd0ce3edfe522ccd735aef7935ae43905427837b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChenyCHENYU/robot-cli/git/commits/94e395520fe714fdfe595a754e0966a2e133238c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119919654?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ChenyCHENYU","id":119919654,"login":"ChenyCHENYU","node_id":"U_kgDOByXUJg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ChenyCHENYU/robot-cli/commit/94e395520fe714fdfe595a754e0966a2e133238c","node_id":"C_kwDOPa-JRdoAKDk0ZTM5NTUyMGZlNzE0ZmRmZTU5NWE3NTRlMDk2NmEyZTEzMzIzOGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ChenyCHENYU/robot-cli/commit/41fe15cfbf1af284c88fdf5cc56f76b0db5cd471","sha":"41fe15cfbf1af284c88fdf5cc56f76b0db5cd471","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChenyCHENYU/robot-cli/commits/41fe15cfbf1af284c88fdf5cc56f76b0db5cd471"}],"sha":"94e395520fe714fdfe595a754e0966a2e133238c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChenyCHENYU/robot-cli/commits/94e395520fe714fdfe595a754e0966a2e133238c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119919654?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ChenyCHENYU","id":119919654,"login":"ChenyCHENYU","node_id":"U_kgDOByXUJg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChenyCHENYU/robot-cli/commits/41fe15cfbf1af284c88fdf5cc56f76b0db5cd471/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-28T16:39:27Z","email":"ycyplus@gmail.com","name":"ChenYu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-28T16:39:27Z","email":"ycyplus@gmail.com","name":"ChenYu"},"message":"feat: use git clone --depth=1 as primary download strategy\n\nHTTP ZIP download was fundamentally wrong for Chinese networks:\n- Gitee ZIP API requires login (returns HTML, not ZIP)\n- GitHub CDN has no Content-Length (no progress bar possible)\n- All timeout/abort issues are side effects of using wrong approach\n\ngit clone --depth=1 is how create-vue/create-vite/degit/giget work:\n- Inherits system git proxy config automatically\n- Real-time progress from git stderr parsing\n- No timeout issues, no ZIP parsing issues\n- HTTP ZIP download demoted to fallback (git not installed)","tree":{"sha":"580cd445007eeff6bdc17bafe39e343c316ad1ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChenyCHENYU/robot-cli/git/trees/580cd445007eeff6bdc17bafe39e343c316ad1ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChenyCHENYU/robot-cli/git/commits/41fe15cfbf1af284c88fdf5cc56f76b0db5cd471","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119919654?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ChenyCHENYU","id":119919654,"login":"ChenyCHENYU","node_id":"U_kgDOByXUJg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ChenyCHENYU/robot-cli/commit/41fe15cfbf1af284c88fdf5cc56f76b0db5cd471","node_id":"C_kwDOPa-JRdoAKDQxZmUxNWNmYmYxYWYyODRjODhmZGY1Y2M1NmY3NmIwZGI1Y2Q0NzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ChenyCHENYU/robot-cli/commit/22dea733145b17eb5bf1a7fb7f496b91a14497b9","sha":"22dea733145b17eb5bf1a7fb7f496b91a14497b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChenyCHENYU/robot-cli/commits/22dea733145b17eb5bf1a7fb7f496b91a14497b9"}],"sha":"41fe15cfbf1af284c88fdf5cc56f76b0db5cd471","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChenyCHENYU/robot-cli/commits/41fe15cfbf1af284c88fdf5cc56f76b0db5cd471"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119919654?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ChenyCHENYU","id":119919654,"login":"ChenyCHENYU","node_id":"U_kgDOByXUJg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChenyCHENYU/robot-cli/commits/22dea733145b17eb5bf1a7fb7f496b91a14497b9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-28T16:29:52Z","email":"ycyplus@gmail.com","name":"ChenYu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-28T16:29:52Z","email":"ycyplus@gmail.com","name":"ChenYu"},"message":"fix: use AbortController connection-only timeout instead of AbortSignal.timeout()\n\nAbortSignal.timeout(ms) is a TOTAL deadline including body streaming.\nLarge templates (10-20MB) simply cannot download in 30s on Chinese networks.\n\nFix: manual AbortController + clearTimeout after headers received.\nBody streams freely with no time limit - same behavior as node-fetch timeout option in v1.x.","tree":{"sha":"75792b858de02d5a6b3de27e7e2fa19812dd1b51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChenyCHENYU/robot-cli/git/trees/75792b858de02d5a6b3de27e7e2fa19812dd1b51"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ChenyCHENYU/robot-cli/git/commits/22dea733145b17eb5bf1a7fb7f496b91a14497b9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/119919654?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ChenyCHENYU","id":119919654,"login":"ChenyCHENYU","node_id":"U_kgDOByXUJg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ChenyCHENYU","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ChenyCHENYU/robot-cli/commit/22dea733145b17eb5bf1a7fb7f496b91a14497b9","node_id":"C_kwDOPa-JRdoAKDIyZGVhNzMzMTQ1YjE3ZWI1YmYxYTdmYjdmNDk2YjkxYTE0NDk3Yjk","parents":[{"html_url":"htt