 a new releaser for vite since your current version.</p>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nUpdates `vite-plugin-single-spa` from 0.7.0 to 1.1.0\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/WJSoftware/vite-plugin-single-spa/releases\">vite-plugin-single-spa''s\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v1.1.0</h2>\n<h2>What''s Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>docs: Update README by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/webJose\"><code>@​webJose</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/WJSoftware/vite-plugin-single-spa/pull/315\">WJSoftware/vite-plugin-single-spa#315</a></li>\n<li>feat: Allow Vite version 7 by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ir31k0\"><code>@​ir31k0</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/WJSoftware/vite-plugin-single-spa/pull/337\">WJSoftware/vite-plugin-single-spa#337</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>New Contributors</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/ir31k0\"><code>@​ir31k0</code></a> made\ntheir first contribution in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/WJSoftware/vite-plugin-single-spa/pull/337\">WJSoftware/vite-plugin-single-spa#337</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/WJSoftware/vite-plugin-single-spa/compare/v1.0.0...v1.1.0\">https://github.com/WJSoftware/vite-plugin-single-spa/compare/v1.0.0...v1.1.0</a></p>\n<h2>v1.0.0</h2>\n<p>Welcome to the first stable release! After 1 year, 8 months and 14\ndays since the first experimental version, we have reached full semantic\nversioning support.</p>\n<h2>What''s Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>build(deps-dev): Bump mocha from 10.8.2 to 11.0.1 by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/WJSoftware/vite-plugin-single-spa/pull/258\">WJSoftware/vite-plugin-single-spa#258</a></li>\n<li>build: Add bash script by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/gsingh-ds\"><code>@​gsingh-ds</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/WJSoftware/vite-plugin-single-spa/pull/278\">WJSoftware/vite-plugin-single-spa#278</a></li>\n<li>build(deps-dev): Bump ts-mocha from 10.0.0 to 11.1.0 by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/WJSoftware/vite-plugin-single-spa/pull/291\">WJSoftware/vite-plugin-single-spa#291</a></li>\n<li>build(deps-dev): Bump <code>@​types/node</code> from 22.10.5 to\n22.13.4 by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/WJSoftware/vite-plugin-single-spa/pull/288\">WJSoftware/vite-plugin-single-spa#288</a></li>\n<li>build(deps-dev): Bump publint from 0.3.0 to 0.3.6 by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/WJSoftware/vite-plugin-single-spa/pull/290\">WJSoftware/vite-plugin-single-spa#290</a></li>\n<li>build(deps-dev): Bump chai from 5.1.2 to 5.2.0 by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/WJSoftware/vite-plugin-single-spa/pull/289\">WJSoftware/vite-plugin-single-spa#289</a></li>\n<li>build(deps-dev): Bump mocha from 10.8.2 to 11.1.0 by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/WJSoftware/vite-plugin-single-spa/pull/279\">WJSoftware/vite-plugin-single-spa#279</a></li>\n<li>chore: Upgrade non-major of packages by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/webJose\"><code>@​webJose</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/WJSoftware/vite-plugin-single-spa/pull/293\">WJSoftware/vite-plugin-single-spa#293</a></li>\n<li>build(deps): Bump esbuild and vite by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/WJSoftware/vite-plugin-single-spa/pull/294\">WJSoftware/vite-plugin-single-spa#294</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>New Contributors</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/gsingh-ds\"><code>@​gsingh-ds</code></a>\nmade their first contribution in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/WJSoftware/vite-plugin-single-spa/pull/278\">WJSoftware/vite-plugin-single-spa#278</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/WJSoftware/vite-plugin-single-spa/compare/v0.9.0...v1.0.0\">https://github.com/WJSoftware/vite-plugin-single-spa/compare/v0.9.0...v1.0.0</a></p>\n<h2>v0.9.0</h2>\n<p>This version adds no new functionality. It is the first generation of\nthe repository after being simplified (to just one package.json file).\nIt contains one potentially breaking change: The <code>resolveId</code>\nhook''s order is now <code>pre</code> to finally get rid of one error\nthat publint kept complaining about.</p>\n<h2>What''s Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>feat: Reorganize package contents by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/webJose\"><code>@​webJose</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/WJSoftware/vite-plugin-single-spa/pull/256\">WJSoftware/vite-plugin-single-spa#256</a></li>\n<li>fix: Remove ex/index.ts to avoid rollup being confused by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/webJose\"><code>@​webJose</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/WJSoftware/vite-plugin-single-spa/pull/264\">WJSoftware/vite-plugin-single-spa#264</a></li>\n<li>build(deps-dev): Bump vite from 6.0.1 to 6.0.5 by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/WJSoftware/vite-plugin-single-spa/pull/263\">WJSoftware/vite-plugin-single-spa#263</a></li>\n<li>build(deps-dev): Bump <code>@​types/node</code> from 22.10.0 to\n22.10.5 by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/WJSoftware/vite-plugin-single-spa/pull/266\">WJSoftware/vite-plugin-single-spa#266</a></li>\n<li>build(deps-dev): Bump typescript from 5.7.2 to 5.7.3 by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://